      "id": "5op3m0gwZjL4udit",
      "name": "Duelist's Challenge",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "5op3m0gwZjL4udit",
        "folder": "ybqQNMU4kFzffOvP",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Duelist's Challenge",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Select one enemy you can see and proclaim a challenge against it. That enemy is your dueling opponent until it's defeated, it flees from the encounter, or the encounter ends. Any time you hit that enemy using a single one-handed melee weapon while your other hand or hands are free, you gain a circumstance bonus to the Strike's damage equal to the number of damage dice your weapon deals.</p>\n<p>If you attack a creature other than your dueling opponent, you take a circumstance penalty to damage equal to the number of damage dice your weapon deals.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Duelist Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "selfEffect": {
            "name": "Effect: Duelist's Challenge",
            "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Duelist's Challenge"
